DESCRIPTION:In this seminar\, I will use one of the inherited diseases tha
 t we study\, Cerebral Cavernous Malformations\, to show how a human genet
 ic study can lead to pathobiological insight and potential avenues to the
 rapy. I will discuss over 3 decades of our research on this topic.
