DESCRIPTION:The Office of Physician-Scientist Development (OPSD) administe
 rs the Duke Strong Start Program\, which is designed to nurture the caree
 rs of junior physician-scientists at Duke pursuing discovery science invo
 lving traditional wet-lab/benchwork and/or advanced computational approac
 hes. \n\nJoin OPSD to recognize Strong Start Awardees in person!\n• Keyno
 te from Gowthami Arepally\, MD\, (Associate Director of Physician-Scienti
 st Development)\n• Presentations from Strong Start Awardees Daniel Nussba
 um (MD)\, Leah Acker (MD\, PhD)\, and Justin Low (MD)\n• Network with Duk
 e physician-scientists\n• Hors d'Oeuvres and drinks will be provided\n\nR
 egister to attend in person on April 21st\, 4-6 PM in MSRBIII Room 1125.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260324T204750Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T160000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260324T204750Z
