DESCRIPTION:EXQUISITE CORPSE\n\nTuesday\, April 21 @ 7:00pm\nRubenstein Ar
 ts Center Film Theater\nFree and Open to the Public\nCo-Presented by Duke
  Screen/Society\nThe MFA EDA friends and family created an ensemble film\
 , all shot on one mini DV tape\, and we all get to see it for the first t
 ime on April 21st!\n\nThis experimental process was inspired by the Dadai
 st game Exquisite Corpse. Those participating in the project only saw the
  last frame of the clip that came before them\, creating a fully in-camer
 a edited\, Frankenstein film. We're excited (and scared) to see what happ
 ens!\n\n"ONCE THE CAMERA COMES OUT\, GOD LEAVES"\n    ⁃ Tom Rankin\n\nCo-
 presented by Duke Master of Fine Arts in Experimental & Documentary Arts 
 program and Duke Screen/Society
DURATION:PT1H
