DESCRIPTION:Double Consciousness: Perspectives on Composition in Black Mus
 ic and Poetry brings together soprano Louise Toppin and pianist John O'Br
 ien (ECU) in a performance and reflection drawn from their work in the Do
 uble Consciousness seminar. This program explores creative and scholarly 
 perspectives on Black musical and poetic expression through composition\,
  interpretation\, and dialogue. Additional collaborators may be announced
  closer to the event date.
