CREATED:20251125T171643Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the second evening of Duke's annual celebration of
  collaborative artistry as Chamber Music at Duke presents another rich pr
 ogram featuring 15-20 student ensembles performing works that span over t
 hree centuries of musical history. This culminating concert highlights th
 e full breadth of the chamber music experience at Duke-from intimate inst
 rumental duos to expansive octets\, showcasing the versatility and creati
 vity of student musicians across campus.\n\nChamber Music at Duke is a fl
 ourishing program open to students of all levels and instruments\, united
  by a shared commitment to listening\, dialogue\, and collective expressi
 on. Advanced ensembles delve deeply into major works of the repertoire\, 
 performing multiple times throughout the year\, while newer instrumentali
 sts discover the joy and discipline of ensemble playing. Together\, they 
 form a vibrant musical community grounded in curiosity\, collaboration\, 
 and mutual support.\n\nTonight's performances bring to life a tapestry of
  musical voices-from Baroque elegance and Classical clarity to Romantic l
 yricism and contemporary innovation. Each ensemble offers its own interpr
 etation\, shaped by weeks of rehearsal\, shared insight\, and the unique 
 chemistry that develops among chamber musicians.\n\nIn a world increasing
 ly defined by division\, chamber music serves as a powerful reminder of w
 hat can be created through deep listening\, respect\, and artistic partne
 rship. This concert invites audiences to witness those values in action a
 nd to celebrate the remarkable work of Duke's student performers.\n\nFree
  and open to the public. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT2H30M
DTSTAMP:20251125T171643Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T193000
LAST-MODIFIED:20251125T171643Z
