DESCRIPTION:Title of Presentation:\n"The Secret to Fostering Successful Su
 rgeon Scientists: Engineering Unfair Advantage"\n\nSpeaker:\nJustin Dimic
 k\, MD\, MPH\nFrederick A. Coller Distinguished Professor\nChair\, Depart
 ment of Surgery\nUniversity of Michigan Medical School\n\n\nThis talk wil
 l be recorded and made available for on-demand viewing. Please visit our 
 website linked below for access.\n\nThe mission of Surgery Grand Rounds i
 s to provide an educational format that has a broad appeal to Duke facult
 y\, residents\, staff\, and students. Grand Rounds consists of a broad ra
 nge of topics that are presented by local\, regional\, and international 
 speakers on clinical education\, research science\, and developments in t
 echnology\, and also addresses other related issues that may affect our c
 urrent and future surgeons. Physicians who attend Surgery Grand Rounds ar
 e eligible to receive CME credit.\n\nFor more information\, please visit 
 our website by clicking on MORE EVENT INFORMATION below
DURATION:PT1H
